# 5. Project Development Phase

**Project Name:** FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

## Development

* Developed the backend using FastAPI.
* Integrated Google Gemini AI for workout plan generation.
* Used Gemini Pro for personalized 7-day workout plans.
* Used Gemini Flash for nutrition and recovery tips.
* Created HTML pages using Jinja2.
* Implemented SQLite database using SQLAlchemy.
* Added feedback-based workout plan updates.
* Created API routes for generating and updating plans.

## Main API Routes

* `/` – Home page
* `/generate-workout` – Generate workout plan
* `/submit-feedback` – Update workout plan using feedback
* `/view-all-users` – View users and plans

## Development Tools

* Python
* FastAPI
* Google Gemini AI
* HTML/CSS/Jinja2
* SQLite
* SQLAlchemy
* Uvicorn
* Git

## Expected Output

A working FitBuddy application that generates personalized workout plans and nutrition tips using Gemini AI.
